WEBVTT

00:07:56.996 --> 00:08:01.829
the room and they learn to wield their
knowledge and expertise like a weapon,

00:08:02.538 --> 00:08:04.996
as opposed to treating it
as a resource to share.

00:08:05.496 --> 00:08:09.996
And so, you know, I think in most
workplaces, in many schools and frankly,

00:08:09.996 --> 00:08:12.746
in too many families and communities, too,
you know,

00:08:12.746 --> 00:08:15.704
the currency of status is knowing
more than everybody else.

00:08:16.454 --> 00:08:21.329
And so knowing that, you know, admitting
what you don't know, questioning yourself,

00:08:21.329 --> 00:08:26.121
showing, you know, any hint of uncertainty
is like admitting weakness

00:08:26.121 --> 00:08:28.246
and setting yourself up
for defeat in battle.

00:08:28.829 --> 00:08:30.329
And obviously, I think that's a problem.